---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Jabalpuriya.com"
  description="Privacy Policy for Jabalpuriya.com outlining our data practices, cookie policies, Google AdSense, and Google Analytics integrations."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-10 px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#0c1c33] rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-xl space-y-8">
      
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-6 space-y-2">
        <span class="px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider bg-jabalpur-secondary/10 text-jabalpur-secondary border border-jabalpur-secondary/20">
          Legal & Compliance
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          Last Updated: October 2026 • Effective Date: October 1, 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Policy Content -->
      <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
        
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Introduction</h2>
          <p>
            Welcome to <strong>Jabalpuriya.com</strong> ("we", "our", or "us"). We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting any personal information collected while you browse our website. This Privacy Policy explains how information is collected, used, and safeguarded when you visit <a href="https://jabalpuriya.com" class="text-jabalpur-secondary underline font-semibold">https://jabalpuriya.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Google AdSense & Third-Party Advertising</h2>
          <p>
            We use third-party advertising companies, including <strong>Google AdSense</strong>, to serve advertisements when you visit our website. These companies may use cookies and web beacons to serve ads based on your prior visits to our website or other websites on the Internet:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>
              <strong>Google's use of advertising cookies:</strong> Google uses cookies (including the DoubleClick DART cookie) to enable it and its partners to serve ads to our users based on their visits to Jabalpuriya.com and/or other sites across the Internet.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Opt-Out Options:</strong> Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-jabalpur-secondary underline font-semibold">Google Ads Settings</a>. Alternatively, you can opt out of third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-jabalpur-secondary underline font-semibold">www.aboutads.info</a>.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Google Analytics & Tracking Technologies</h2>
          <p>
            We use <strong>Google Analytics</strong> (Measurement ID: <code>G-6XS7238KSC</code>) to analyze traffic and visitor behavior to improve our local news coverage and website performance. Google Analytics collects aggregated, non-personally identifiable information such as browser type, operating system, referring pages, and timestamp.
          </p>
          <p>
            You can prevent your data from being used by Google Analytics by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-jabalpur-secondary underline font-semibold">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. Log Files & Cookies</h2>
          <p>
            Like most standard websites, Jabalpuriya.com utilizes log files and browser cookies. The information inside the log files includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, type of browser, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date/time stamp, referring/exit pages, and number of clicks. This data is not linked to any information that is personally identifiable and is used solely for analyzing trends, administering the site, and preventing DDoS abuse.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">5. Children's Information</h2>
          <p>
            Protecting the privacy of young children is especially important. Jabalpuriya.com does not knowingly collect any personal identifiable information from children under the age of 13. If a parent or guardian believes that Jabalpuriya.com has in its database the personally-identifiable information of a child under the age of 13, please contact us immediately.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">6. Your Data Rights</h2>
          <p>
            Under applicable data protection laws (including the Digital Personal Data Protection Act of India, GDPR, and CCPA), you have the right to request access to, rectification of, or erasure of your personal data.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">7. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions, feedback, or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact our Editorial and Compliance Desk:
          </p>
          <div class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-sm">
            <p><strong>Website:</strong> Jabalpuriya.com</p>
            <p><strong>Contact & Queries:</strong> <a href="/contact" class="text-jabalpur-secondary underline font-semibold">Online Contact & Feedback Desk</a></p>
            <p><strong>Location:</strong> Jabalpur, Madhya Pradesh, India (PIN 482001)</p>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>

      <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-center">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm bg-jabalpur-primary text-white hover:bg-jabalpur-secondary transition-all shadow-md">
          ← Back to Jabalpuriya Home
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
